# Xcode projects: only WraithBox.xcodeproj's project file is tracked.
# xcodebuild writes project.xcworkspace and xcuserdata next to it.
*.xcodeproj/*
!/packages/wraithbox-swift/WraithBox.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
xcuserdata/

